# Customer 360 Platform

This project builds a unified customer profile by combining CRM, web and support data.

## Business Problem
Customer data comes from multiple systems with:
- Duplicates
- Inconsistent country formats
- Dirty phone numbers

## Solution
- Normalize data
- Deduplicate customers
- Merge data into a single Snowflake table

## Output
A clean Customer 360 table used by marketing, sales and support.

